\033[38;5;223m  HOW TO BROWSE\033[0m

\033[38;5;87m  Links and form controls have numbers. Type a number and press Enter\033[0m
\033[38;5;87m  to activate it, or move the ring with Tab and press Enter. Use Up and\033[0m
\033[38;5;87m  Down to scroll; hold an arrow for continuous scrolling. J and K scroll\033[0m
\033[38;5;87m  one line at a time.\033[0m

\033[38;5;87m  WHY+L opens the omnibox: type an address, or some words to search\033[0m
\033[38;5;87m  Google. WHY+F finds a word on the page, WHY+V shows just the article,\033[0m
\033[38;5;87m  WHY+= and WHY+- change the text size. Forgot a key? Press WHY+/.\033[0m


